&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-字体制作&#34;&gt;2. 字体制作
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（1）准备一张斜纹镂空图片，可以按上述方法手动制作，或者使用下面我制作好的图片&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B045%E5%BA%A6%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%BF.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2400&#34;
	height=&#34;1010&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B045%E5%BA%A6%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%BF_hu15352555470979965353.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B045%E5%BA%A6%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%BF_hu15308693044092876697.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;237&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;570px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（2）文字工具输入想要的文字，调整图层位置，斜纹镂空图片在上，文字在下&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1793&#34;
	height=&#34;989&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C1_hu16782138957320025299.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C1_hu13901043881077233122.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;181&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;435px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（3）斜纹镂空图片右键创建剪贴蒙版&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;551&#34;
	height=&#34;599&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2_hu18285608913521648413.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2_hu10727906397327464418.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;91&#34;
